        children: "flowchart TD\n    subgraph Daily[Daily Actions]\n        P30[30 min focused study] --> W3[3.5 hours per week]\n        W3 --> Y182[182 hours per year]\n        Y182 --> C[Compounds via knowledge stacking<br/>Each new concept builds on previous]\n    end\n    subgraph Result[Year End Result]\n        C --> R1[23 full workdays of learning]\n        R1 --> R2[1.01^365 = 38x improvement]\n        R2 --> R3[Deep expertise in your field]\n    end\n    subgraph Risk[The Opposite]\n        Skip[Skip a day] --> G[Gap forms]\n        G --> S[Compound decay<br/>0.99^365 = 0.03]\n    end\n"
